      "seed": 1180089175,
      "version": 527,
      "versionNonce": 342023191,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792502301147,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Both come from one kernel at build time, but as \ntwo separate things.\n\nTo Rust the PTX is just bytes: it can't look inside and check\nthey match.\n\nunsafe = our promise: this PTX belongs with these methods\n(same arguments, same order).\n\ncargo oxide builds both from the same source, so in practice\nit always holds.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Both come from one kernel at build time, but as \ntwo separate things.\n\nTo Rust the PTX is just bytes: it can't look inside and check\nthey match.\n\nunsafe = our promise: this PTX belongs with these methods\n(same arguments, same order).\n\ncargo oxide builds both from the same source, so in practice\nit always holds.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
